------------------------------------------------------------------------
Adapted work
------------------------------------------------------------------------

Two pieces were adapted, not copied. No file from either project is in
this repository; both are MIT licensed.

  The orb's WebGL fragment shader (src/handoff/web/static/orb.js) is
  adapted from DORA's volumetric orb, with a transparent background and
  audio-reactive uniforms added.
    DORA — MIT — https://github.com/Aaditya1273/DORA

  The visual language of the app and the site (the oklch cream palette,
  the glass and accent surfaces, the drift wall and the clipped footer
  wordmark) is re-expressed from Agent.md's site against Handoff's own
  design tokens.
    Agent.md — MIT — https://github.com/Aaditya1273/Agent.md

Terminal screenshots in docs/screens were rendered with freeze
(charmbracelet, MIT) in Cascadia Code (Microsoft, SIL OFL 1.1).
